<title>JAPAN: Sagami Railway - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sagami Railway - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 59.24		vs	   59.15</p>
<p> Operating	    6.52		vs	    7.10</p>
<p> Current		1.39		vs	    1.87</p>
<p> Net		    1.32		vs	    1.23</p>
<p> EPS		    3.21 yen	  vs	    2.98 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    412 million	  vs	 412 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sagami Railway Co Ltd is a Yokohama-based railway company.</p>
</text>
